**定义 4.3（行列式余式、真实响应余式及混合式）。** 定义

$$
\begin{gathered}
\mathsf D=\mathrm{Den}(\mathsf T),\qquad \delta=\det\mathsf D,\\
\mathbf U=\operatorname{adj}(\mathsf D)N_M(\mathsf T)\mathbf e_0,
\qquad \mathbf W=\operatorname{adj}(\mathsf D)N_J(\mathsf T)\mathbf e_0,\\
U(t)=U_0+U_1t+U_2t^2,\qquad W(t)=W_0+W_1t+W_2t^2,\\
u_2=U_2,\quad v_2=W_2,\quad p_u=U_1,\quad p_v=W_1.
\end{gathered}
\tag{4.5}
$$

$\mathbf U,\mathbf W$ 为升幂系数列。它们的每个分量和下式都是四变量的有限多项式表达式：

$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathcal J_2={}&(s_2+s_1^2)u_2^2v_2^2
+2s_1(p_uu_2v_2^2+p_vv_2u_2^2)\\
&+p_u^2v_2^2+p_up_vu_2v_2+p_v^2u_2^2,\\
\mathcal J_3={}&s_3u_2^2v_2^2
+(s_1u_2+p_u)(s_1v_2+p_v)(s_1u_2v_2+p_uv_2+p_vu_2).
\end{aligned}
\tag{4.6}
$$

